# Deterministic line endings across Windows dev machines and Linux CI.
# Biome enforces LF; without this file a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true)
# materializes CRLF and `pnpm lint` fails on a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never EOL-convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.woff2 binary
